cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "hagrid — A JavaScript Library for Removing Overlaps in Scatterplots"
abstract: >-
  A JavaScript library that removes overlaps in scatterplots by snapping points
  onto a grid, using space filling curves and related techniques: Hilbert,
  generalized Hilbert and Gosper curves, alongside reimplementations of DGrid,
  constrained MDS, N-Map and GridFit behind a single API.
